   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Four variations of one prompt (four seeds in one batch), saved one by one AND as a 2×2 grid sheet to compare.\nKeep the seed fixed to re-make the same four; roll it for four new ones. Change the batch in the sampler size only together with the grid (it takes the first four).\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
